  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PACT Promoting citizen engagement in decentralisation 2012-2016 - Promoting Citizen Engagement in Decentralization</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">PACT &#xd6;kat medborgerligt deltagande i decentralisering</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">I ljuset av den decentraliseringsprocessen beh&#xf6;ver folkligt deltagande utvecklas i Kambodja. Projektet syftar specifikt till: 1.  &#xd6;kad kommunikation mellan medborgarna 2. &#xd6;kat antal beslut tagna av   valda f&#xf6;rsamlingar p&#xe5; distriktsniv&#xe5; &#xe4;r direkt p&#xe5;verkade av            medborgarnas deltagande 3. Kambodjas politik kring decentralisering   &#xe4;r mer p&#xe5;verkat av civila samh&#xe4;llets engagemang.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In light of the decentralization process in Cambodia, civic engagement needs to be further developed in Cambodia. The project aim at: 1. Increase communication among citizens 2. More district council actions are directly influenced by diverse citizen                    participation.3.	Government policies around sub-national democratic   development are more influenced by civil society.</narrative>
  </description>
